OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 25 MAR
OL,4,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,5,     GFrom Manchester's Bridgewater
OL,6,     GHall, the BBC Philharmonic,
OL,7,     Gconducted by Ludovic Morlot,
OL,8,     Gplays love-inspired music by
OL,9,     GProkofiev, Cassandra Miller and
OL,10,     GBerg.
OL,11,G2145FThe Essay: Erland Cooper's Cities
OL,12,     Fof the Imagination
OL,13,     GComposer Erland Cooper discovers
OL,14,     Gthe mythical city of Ker-Is,
OL,15,     GBrittany's sunken city of excess,
OL,16,     Gwhere ancient flood myths meet
OL,17,     Gmodern climate reality and Celtic
OL,18,     Glegend.
